Neon Self-hosted Control Plane
Copyright 2026 the control-plane contributors.

This independent project integrates with Neon open source components.
Neon and PostgreSQL source repositories and container images retain their own
licenses and notices. They are external deployment dependencies, not relicensed
by this repository. No ownership of Neon names or marks is asserted.

Go module dependencies are declared in api/go.mod and api/go.sum.
Web dependencies are declared in web/package.json and web/package-lock.json.
Container CI emits per-image SBOM and build provenance. Operators must review
dependency licenses and security advisories for their own distribution.
